@startuml
actor Caller
participant LifecycleController as Lifecycle
participant ProviderComposition as Composition
participant CommunicationProvider as Provider
Caller -> Lifecycle: declare and validate endpoints and route
Caller -> Composition: prepare(route spec, exact handles)
Composition -> Lifecycle: authenticate snapshots and retained declarations
Composition -> Composition: compare complete declarations and capabilities
Composition -> Provider: private prepare operation
Provider --> Composition: internal prepared result
Composition --> Caller: composition-issued provider-route handle
Caller -> Composition: activate(exact provider-route handle)
Composition -> Lifecycle: require validated route and active endpoints
Composition -> Provider: private activate operation
Provider --> Composition: bounded status
Composition -> Lifecycle: activate exact route
Lifecycle --> Composition: active route snapshot
Composition --> Caller: ProviderStatus
Caller -> Composition: submit(exact handle, immutable item)
Composition -> Lifecycle: authenticate active route and endpoints
Composition -> Composition: validate complete item binding
Composition -> Provider: private submit operation
Provider --> Composition: bounded outcome
Composition --> Caller: bounded outcome
@enduml
